@baseUrl = http://localhost:5261
@documentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Upload a PDF (adjust the path to a file on your machine)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary--

### List documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents

### Get one document (check its status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}

### Ask a question across all documents
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is this document about?"
}

### Ask a question restricted to specific documents
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What are the main conclusions?",
  "documentIds": ["{{documentId}}"],
  "topK": 8
}

### Delete a document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}
